<title>USA: PaineWebber wins $101 mln of Wisconsin GO bonds.</title>
<headline>PaineWebber wins $101 mln of Wisconsin GO bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said it won $101 million of Wisconsin general obligation bonds with a true interest cost (TIC) 4.84 percent.</p>
</text>
